+  read or measured here.
+- No prior run's output (size in MB, turn/episode counts, or ingest
+  duration) is recorded anywhere in this repo's docs, git history, or
+  build artifacts.
+
+If real numbers are needed, run the smoke test (or the `ingest_transcript`
+entry point in `crates/muninn-capture/src/ingest.rs`) against an actual
+transcript file and record the reported size, turn count, episode count,
+and elapsed time here.
